    {
      "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133144",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "HORTENSIO.\nA will make the man mad, to make a woman of him.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133144/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133144/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 59,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5626013,
        "end": 5626086,
        "line": 208903,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap31/p@133144",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_31.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "HORTENSIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133221",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "KATHERINA.\nYoung budding virgin, fair and fresh and sweet,\nWhither away, or where is thy abode?\nHappy the parents of so fair a child;\nHappier the man whom favourable stars\nAllot thee for his lovely bedfellow.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133221/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133221/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133221/line-3",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 95,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133221/line-4",
          "start": 96,
          "end": 133,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133221/line-5",
          "start": 134,
          "end": 171,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133221/line-6",
          "start": 172,
          "end": 208,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5626090,
        "end": 5626332,
        "line": 208907,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap31/p@133221",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_31.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "KATHERINA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133467",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "PETRUCHIO.\nWhy, how now, Kate! I hope thou art not mad:\nThis is a man, old, wrinkled, faded, wither’d,\nAnd not a maiden, as thou sayst he is.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133467/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133467/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 55,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133467/line-3",
          "start": 56,
          "end": 102,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133467/line-4",
          "start": 103,
          "end": 141,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5626336,
        "end": 5626501,
        "line": 208915,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap31/p@133467",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_31.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PETRUCHIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133636",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "KATHERINA.\nPardon, old father, my mistaking eyes,\nThat have been so bedazzled with the sun\nThat everything I look on seemeth green:\nNow I perceive thou art a reverend father;\nPardon, I pray thee, for my mad mistaking.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133636/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133636/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133636/line-3",
          "start": 50,
          "end": 90,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133636/line-4",
          "start": 91,
          "end": 131,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133636/line-5",
          "start": 132,
          "end": 174,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133636/line-6",
          "start": 175,
          "end": 217,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5626505,
        "end": 5626756,
        "line": 208921,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap31/p@133636",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_31.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "KATHERINA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133891",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "PETRUCHIO.\nDo, good old grandsire, and withal make known\nWhich way thou travellest: if along with us,\nWe shall be joyful of thy company.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133891/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133891/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 56,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133891/line-3",
          "start": 57,
          "end": 101,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-taming-of-the-shrew/sceneIV_31.5/p@133891/line-4",
          "start": 102,
          "end": 136,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5626760,
        "end": 5626920,
        "line": 208929,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap31/p@133891",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_31.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PETRUCHIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
